Package: dbSNP4Bioc
Title: Build, Cache and Query dbSNP VCF Data as Parquet
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Vince", "Carey", email = "stvjc@channing.harvard.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts a single chromosome of an NCBI dbSNP VCF (as
    distributed, bgzipped and tabix-indexed) into a slim, sorted Parquet
    representation, caches it locally with BiocFileCache, and exposes the
    cached resource as a tidyverse-compatible lazy table (via dplyr/dbplyr
    on top of duckdb) so that rsID and genomic-position lookups can be
    expressed with ordinary dplyr::filter()/select() pipelines.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
